{
  "text": "For your safety, we require signature for this laptop. FedEx left a door tag yesterday. Please sign it or pick up at depot. We cannot remove signature required once shipped."
}

{
  "text": "We apologize. Your GigaWidget was sent with tracking TRK-44910. A replacement will arrive by November 5."
}

{
  "text": "You enabled two-factor authentication. Please use recovery codes. If you deleted the authenticator app without saving backups, your account is permanently lost."
}

{
  "text": "Your double charged amount has been refunded (Refund-909). Funds will reflect in 3-5 business days."
}

{
  "text": "Your account is suspended for Terms of Service violations. Submit a formal appeal via the legal link. Please avoid live chat harassment until resolved."
}

{
  "text": "Your package is held up in international customs. Please provide your Tax ID directly to customs. This is not our responsibility."
}

{
  "text": "Your device's serial number does not match. The broken seal voided warranty. The Return Dept will ship it back at your expense."
}

{
  "text": "Your item is in worn condition. Per Policy 4B, we may reject it. We've issued store credit. Please return future items in good condition."
}

{
  "text": "The item is backordered. The supplier error delays stock until January. Please wait or cancel. No daily updates required."
}

{
  "text": "Thank you. We'll send a new Custom Mug by December 1 to replace the damaged one. Please discard the broken item and avoid blurry photos."
}

{
  "text": "As you cancelled early, we issued a prorated refund for unused days: $12.50."
}

{
  "text": "Your promotional code SAVE20 has expired. We cannot honor it. Please pay full price or empty cart."
}

{
  "text": "Please email help@example.com from your registered address to reset your password per security protocol. This takes 24 hours."
}

{
  "text": "I hope you could access the Zoom link for Consultation. Please reschedule for next month."
}

{
  "text": "Please merge accounts once to prevent data loss. A System Admin must run a script to fix this. We won't repeat."
}

{
  "text": "Your bank account went negative. Contact your bank if a subscription caused an overdraft."
}

{
  "text": "For a username change, go to the Settings tab and click edit. If needed, email admin@example.org."
}
